cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the FGKB-Reason benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fgkb-llm: FunGramKB deep conceptual semantics for open LLMs (code and FGKB-Reason benchmark)"
abstract: >-
  Code, benchmark generator and preregistered analysis for a controlled comparison of ways of supplying
  FunGramKB meaning postulates to open LLMs (graph context, dense retrieval and a neuro-symbolic pipeline that
  translates questions into COREL queries answered by an answer-set-programming reasoner), evaluated on
  FGKB-Reason, a bilingual (English/Spanish) benchmark of deep lexical-conceptual reasoning.
